WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.991
This video shows how to move money between two accounts on your phone, for example from cash to the bank.

00:00:08.671 --> 00:00:18.247
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Accounts. Then tap the Transfers tab to see the transfers made so far.

00:00:19.382 --> 00:00:24.830
Tap Record Transfer at the top of the page. A form opens.

00:00:25.627 --> 00:00:34.915
Choose the From Account, the account the money leaves, here Main Cash. Then choose the To Account, the account that receives it, here School Bank.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:43.842
Enter the amount, here 5000, and a short description, here Deposit to bank. The date is today by default.

00:00:47.029 --> 00:00:56.005
Tap Review Transfer. The form changes to a summary with the From and To accounts, the amount and the date, and nothing is saved yet.

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:10.727
Check the details and tap Confirm Transfer. A message says the transfer was recorded, and it appears in the list.

00:01:14.185 --> 00:01:19.705
The transfer is recorded. Both account balances now include it.
